  "description": "Kshetrabasi Juanga, a Juang speaker from Keonjhar district, Odisha, India, talks about how far his language has been documented. Opino Gomango interviewed him in Bhubaneswar, Odisha, India. Juanga translated his words from Juang into Odia, Gomango wrote the English subtitles from that translation, and Subhashish Panigrahi edited them. Panigrahi edited the footage and published it under the OpenSpeaks Archives project in 2026. This interview was commissioned, and Gomango and Juanga hold the moral rights.",
